  "worked_solution": "To find the trace in the $xy$-plane, we substitute $z=0$ into the equation of the elliptic cone, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}9(x-2)^{2}+2{y}^{2}=18(0)^{2} \\\\ 9(x-2)^{2}+2{y}^{2}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis gives in the $xy$-plane the point $(2,0,0).$",
